# This directory holds your per-machine agent manifests, written by
# `crow setup` (or copied from examples/agents/ for custom setups).
#
# It is .gitignored — committed manifests would be useless to anyone
# else (different binary paths, SSH hosts, WSL distros, etc.).
#
# This .gitkeep exists only so the directory is present on a fresh
# clone, so `cargo run --bin crow -- setup` has somewhere to write.
